        </span>
      </div>
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The billing demand is based on a rolling 12 month average of the Transmission Customer's load under the Tariff coincident with the Transmission Provider's monthly transmission peak load. The demand reported in column h is the most recent 12 month average load for the quarter.</span>
      </div>
